# Abigale, Eloquent First-Year: "When Abigale enters, up to one other target creature loses all abilities. Put a flying
# counter, a first strike counter, and a lifelink counter on that creature."
# Abigale's trigger targets Bot2's Cecil, Dark Knight (deathtouch; "whenever Cecil deals damage, you lose that much life").
# Cecil loses both and has the three counters, put on after the loss, so it has flying, first strike and lifelink (CR 122.1b,
# 613.7c; the ruling). On turn 4 Cecil attacks unblocked: Bot1 takes 2, and Bot2 gains 2 by lifelink and loses none to the
# lost Darkness ability (with it Bot2 would be back at 20, without lifelink at 18).
# Abigale has its own flying, first strike and lifelink. Mox Pearl and Mox Jet pay {W/B}{W/B}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Cecil, Dark Knight
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Target(Cecil, Dark Knight)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Lifelink
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Flying = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.FirstStrike = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Lifelink = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Cecil, Dark Knight > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 22
Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Lifelink
Bot1.Battlefield.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Lifelink
